WEBVTT

00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:14,070
If I start a new supplement, or Ivermectin, how long does it take to see a difference?

00:00:14,070 --> 00:00:21,280
Well, if you're talking about cancer, how long does it take to see a difference?

00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:28,280
Unfortunately, it can take months before you see a difference on a change in supplement regimen.

00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:34,280
So, don't be discouraged if you don't see a difference in a couple of weeks.

00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:40,280
But if you don't see a difference in three months when the cancer is still growing,

00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:46,280
or your numbers are going the wrong way still in three months, then we need to change things.

00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:54,280
But if, let's say you started on a supplement two weeks ago that had blood work done and there wasn't anything improved,

00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:59,280
and if that had effect things were worse, then, you know, we don't know yet.

00:00:59,280 --> 00:01:06,280
So, it takes some time for things to change, so just going to be aware of that.

